WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:12.530
Meet Minova Chromium 1.0.5. A new Safari-inspired interface, a polished Liquid Glass theme, and a complete visual identity join the browser you already know.

2
00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:24.800
Choose the new Safari-style interface for a centered Smart Search field, familiar traffic-light window controls, compact rounded tabs, and every Minova tool in one precise toolbar.

3
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:36.614
Liquid Glass adds layered translucency, saturation, and depth while preserving readable contrast. The theme is designed for daily use and includes a softer light appearance.

4
00:00:36.314 --> 00:00:51.092
Workspace, Classic, and Safari layouts now live side by side. Change the interface for the task at hand without giving up extensions, streaming, local A I, Audio Studio, or privacy controls.

5
00:00:50.792 --> 00:01:02.498
The new Prism M and custom Minova wordmark create one consistent identity across the browser, installer, website, release artwork, and Windows executable.

6
00:01:02.198 --> 00:01:17.240
Version 1.0.5 also strengthens frameless window behavior. Dragging, resizing, minimizing, maximizing, restoring, and closing remain reliable in Safari mode and across the other interfaces.

7
00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:28.886
The complete visual identity is now published as a reusable brand kit with vector masters, icon exports, design tokens, templates, and clear usage guidance.

8
00:01:28.586 --> 00:01:36.980
Minova Chromium 1.0.5. Three interfaces, one focused browser. Shape your own path.
